@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1
@userToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@operatorToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@organizationId = REPLACE
@documentId = REPLACE
@documentVersionId = REPLACE
@applicationId = REPLACE
@grantId = REPLACE
@caseId = REPLACE
@submissionId = REPLACE

### Run scripts/initialize-document-key.ps1 locally before using the vault.
### Upload: POST /me/documents or /organizations/{organizationId}/documents.
### Send bounded multipart/form-data with known Content-Length <=11MB:
### metadata (application/json):
### {"requestId":"FRESH_UUID","version":0,"category":"IDENTITY","title":"Identity front scan","retainUntil":"FUTURE_INSTANT_WITHIN_TEN_YEARS"}
### file: a valid JPEG/PNG scan <=10MB. PDF and other arbitrary files are rejected.
### Multi-page evidence uses separate documents; immutable replacements use POST /{id}/versions
### with current version and unchanged document identity/retention.

GET {{base}}/me/documents/storage-status
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Private metadata
GET {{base}}/me/documents?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Download exact encrypted-at-rest scan through the authorized application endpoint
GET {{base}}/me/documents/{{documentId}}/versions/{{documentVersionId}}/content
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Explicit screening share. Replace UUID/time/applicationVersion from current responses.
POST {{base}}/me/applications/{{applicationId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","applicationVersion":0,"documentId":"{{documentId}}","documentVersionId":"{{documentVersionId}}","expiresAt":"2026-10-23T12:00:00Z","consent":true}

### Revoke without deleting original evidence
POST {{base}}/me/applications/{{applicationId}}/documents/{{grantId}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222","version":0,"reason":"Screening consent withdrawn."}

### Create private identity case; business cases use organization prefix and registration scans.
POST {{base}}/me/verifications
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333","details":{"claimedName":"Your declared identity name","countryCode":"KE","statement":"I confirm these exact document versions relate to my declared identity.","documentVersionIds":["{{documentVersionId}}"]}}

### Submit exact bundle with password entered locally; never commit real credentials.
POST {{base}}/me/verifications/{{caseId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444","version":0,"submissionId":"{{submissionId}}","consent":true,"password":"ENTER_LOCALLY"}

### Metadata-only queue
GET {{base}}/admin/verifications?status=SUBMITTED&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### Independent operator claims the current queue version
POST {{base}}/admin/verifications/{{caseId}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555","version":1,"password":"ENTER_LOCALLY","reason":"Assigned for independent manual document review."}

### Only assigned current independent reviewer can access the frozen bundle
GET {{base}}/admin/verifications/{{caseId}}/evidence
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### Audited single-version content; other versions remain inaccessible
GET {{base}}/admin/verifications/{{caseId}}/evidence/{{documentVersionId}}/content
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### Decide only after actual manual checks; deadline <=365 days and covered by retention.
POST {{base}}/admin/verifications/{{caseId}}/decide
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666","version":2,"decision":"VERIFY","validUntil":"2026-12-01T12:00:00Z","checksConfirmed":true,"password":"ENTER_LOCALLY","reason":"Completed independent manual review of the declared information and scanned evidence."}

### Owner progress and current status
GET {{base}}/me/verifications/{{caseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Status summary; no external registry/KYC provider is implied
GET {{base}}/me/verifications/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Withdraw also removes current verified status/reviewer access
POST {{base}}/me/verifications/{{caseId}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777777","version":3,"reason":"I withdraw this verification and its continuing use."}

### Archive before purge. Existing grants are permanently revoked.
POST {{base}}/me/documents/{{documentId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"88888888-8888-4888-8888-888888888888","version":0,"reason":"Document is no longer needed for active use."}

### Only after retention deadline and no holds: commit irreversible purge intention.
POST {{base}}/me/documents/{{documentId}}/purge
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999","version":1,"consent":true,"password":"ENTER_LOCALLY","reason":"Remove encrypted file payloads after the configured retention period."}

### Process/retry committed deletion tasks; metadata and audit evidence remain.
POST {{base}}/me/documents/{{documentId}}/purge/process
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa","version":2,"reason":"Process the committed document payload purge."}
